SpendWise – Website Deployment
Project Description

SpendWise is a personal finance management website designed to help users monitor expenses, manage budgets and improve their financial habits.

Deployment Technologies
HTML
CSS
JavaScript
GitHub
Netlify
Deployment Process
Organized the project files for deployment.
Created a public GitHub repository.
Uploaded the SpendWise project to GitHub.
Connected the repository to Netlify.
Deployed the website.
Customized the Netlify site name.
Tested continuous deployment by pushing a visible update to GitHub.
Verified the deployed website.
